[{"title":"梅旅度曲以秋宵闻歌为韵 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"神仙富贵未蹉跎，自古英雄白首多。\n请语梅花楼外月，清光长照玉人歌。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13272,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"垓下 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"战鼓无声落日黄，英雄自古是天亡。\n乌骓不失阴陵道，岂有山东与汉王。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13273,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"垓下 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"战血淋漓洒美人，君王意气委黄尘。\n多情不渡乌江水，为有红颜在草茵。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13274,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"江深阁眺望","author":"屈大均","text":"缥缈青山接燕矶，风吹浮玉渡江飞。\n谁家故起真州阁，收尽江南彩翠归。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13275,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"从京江至石头城作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"潮去潮来怒未平，蕲王庙口客心惊。\n天风不断黄天荡，知是当年战鼓声。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13276,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"从京江至石头城作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"新长沙洲廿里长，蒹葭斜抱石城墙。\n江南岁岁添形势，料得天心在建康。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13277,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"遥题朱氏柳城","author":"屈大均","text":"十万垂杨作一城，双堤流水绕香粳。\n中田百顷桃花里，安得斯人共耦耕。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13278,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题李咸若哺园 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"签蟹新肥煮酒香，旅人初在泰州尝。\n知君家有茅容母，更买鲈鱼奉一觞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13279,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题李咸若哺园 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"一路车篷夹岸多，一重官柳一重河。\n天寒不惜牵舟苦，为有君园在薜萝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13280,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"青溪观虞美人作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"天生意气逐重瞳，血作名花万古红。\n开遍青溪与罂粟，枝枝平舞美人风。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13281,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"青溪观虞美人作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"一带溪桥隐暮烟，开残芍药马蹄边。\n红颜尽是閒花草，似尔虞兮自可怜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13282,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"青溪观虞美人作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"战血何妨染玉颜，花开长使美人攀。\n二妃不为重华死，那得潇湘竹尽斑。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13283,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"夜饮海棠花下口占","author":"屈大均","text":"却嫌月照海棠白，花下频将蜡炬催。\n竹叶未倾颜已赭，明霞朵朵火中开。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13284,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"长忆","author":"屈大均","text":"长忆明星玉女宫，洗头盆映暮霞红。\n飞泉乱出莲花腹，散作诸溪处处通。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13285,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"玉川门作","author":"屈大均","text":"乱瀑淙淙响石床，梦馀无奈落花香。\n含毫欲写泉三叠，心与云英化水光。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13286,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题寒山子图 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"閒与天台扫落花，花花扫尽扫云霞。\n云霞亦是吾馀物，流出人间带日华。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13287,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题寒山子图 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"天半飞桥势欲飞，赤城霞作羽人衣。\n天风不断松间起，乱洒流泉湿翠微。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13288,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"席上吟赠林茂之八十翁","author":"屈大均","text":"明月飞来珠海长，愁心尽与白云乡。\n高歌试问投竿老，我是今狂定古狂。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13289,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"答王璞庵","author":"屈大均","text":"谁能学道更情深，兴俗今朝共陆沉。\n金粟如来吾不屑，但将尊酒送狂吟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13290,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"幽州歌送客","author":"屈大均","text":"幽州二月柳堪把，小姬邀客玉河下。\n莫道酡酥不醉人，频向津楼系白马。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13291,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"淮南王","author":"屈大均","text":"淮南自善离骚赋，不必诸儒大小山。\n已作三闾高弟子，绝胜黄屋入秦关。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13292,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"归风词 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"云舟轻漾采菱蕖，太液池中春雨馀。\n飞燕随风欲入水，君王频为结缨裙。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13293,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"荚陵","author":"屈大均","text":"暮烟朝雨荚陵开，环佩珊珊去不回。\n终古哀蝉将落叶，君王泪洒集仙台。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13294,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠张于归西泠 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"新声乐府推君妙，白燕丁香赋并传。\n燕女争歌玉河柳，扬州更爱竹枝篇。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13295,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠张于归西泠 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"御沟春水玉河通，夹岸花飞随玉骢。\n欲赠君归须芍药，佳人争买点桩红。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13296,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠张于归西泠 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"归泛西湖水渺茫，家临湖墅足蚕桑。\n梅花若向西溪问，曲曲渔舟共陆郎。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13297,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"尔祖丹青似辋川，草书团扇世争传。\n今君妙写沧洲趣，待诏风流在目前。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13298,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"乱后阊门无旧业，玉兰台馆委烽烟。\n移家远向天池住，文肃松楸怆墓田。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13299,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"东望莫釐西缥缈，天池楼阁太湖边。\n经营响屧琴台月，挥洒金庭玉柱烟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13300,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"商山四皓多苗裔，遍植梅花林屋间。\n我昔采香西子径，洞庭春尽不知还。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13301,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"梦中林屋树苍苍，掩映人家橘柚黄。\n更有杨梅无数树，蒲萄处处绿阴凉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13302,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"文与也为予写西洞庭图赋此以赠 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"凭君点染包山翠，多写毛公洞口松。\n挂向长安散炎暑，一杯一朵玉芙蓉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13303,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"阿珠曲","author":"屈大均","text":"今夕觞同河汉倾，满堂凫藻目先成。\n但教南海明珠在，不必青天皎月生。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13304,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"戏赠邯郸少年","author":"屈大均","text":"邯郸公子善娱宾，玉貌樽前映塞春。\n欲得荆轲捐七尺，祗须宝马与佳人。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13305,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"华游口号 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"身轻忽到巨灵旁，长揖明星乞玉浆。\n十丈莲茎持作杖，因探玉并不嫌长。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13306,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"华游口号 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"洗头盆里水初寒，明月偏宜镜里看。\n二十八潭閒照遍，玉颜新似水花丹。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13307,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"华山下二泉","author":"屈大均","text":"玉女祠前有醴泉，张超谷在玉泉边。\n二泉酿就三峰去，醉向仙人掌上眠。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13308,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"河干怅望","author":"屈大均","text":"渭川东泻黄河月，雷首西横太华云。\n咫尺蒲关愁不度，明星玉女惜离群。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13309,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"寄彭荆山山人","author":"屈大均","text":"袅袅天边铁绠垂，攀援无那峡风吹。\n愁君日向苍龙岭，鸾鹤翩翩不可追。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13310,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送客","author":"屈大均","text":"青州玉露胜金露，君去青州作酒人。\n一醉莫教三十日，醉乡春好本非春。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13311,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"雁门七夕即事 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"今夕双星乐事多，愁人不寐盻银河。\n云中有路通明月，谁许乘槎泛浩波。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13312,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"雁门七夕即事 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"滹沱秋水耶溪似，莲叶东西见彼姝。\n万里长风吹海月，可怜光堕锦氍毹。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13313,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"雁门七夕即事 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"巫山句注两氤氲，十二芙蓉望不分。\n最喜黄牛朝暮见，俨如神女在行云。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13314,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"雁门七夕即事 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"天边明月不曾愁，万里青光上塞楼。\n我似微云在河汉，依依长抱玉盘游。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13315,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"雁门七夕即事 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"一曲归风响入云，留仙争把汉宫裙。\n思为海燕巢君屋，处处衔将兰蕙芬。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13316,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"豹突泉","author":"屈大均","text":"潺湲一道落桑乾，中有征人泪未寒。\n愁绝三云驱马去，年年花向战场看。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13317,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"九月","author":"屈大均","text":"九月辽东衰草多，飞霜乱下白狼河。\n人人马上吹芦管，夜夜城头枕铁戈。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13318,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"云中词","author":"屈大均","text":"薄暮桑乾大猎还，纷纷雨雪暗关山。\n天寒不惜貂裘典，一醉春光上玉颜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13319,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"入塞行","author":"屈大均","text":"万里挥鞭辞玉颜，愁心不断似天山。\n天生飞将从无命，笑向沙场射虎还。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13320,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"怀沈武功 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"卿本佳人自不知，相逢蔓草露零时。\n殷勤问我离骚赋，欲共潇湘采竹枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13321,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"怀沈武功 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"怅望湖天祗去鸿，洞庭花映白云空。\n银鱼一尺春来美，欲寄相思秀水东。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13322,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白华园送客口号 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"白雨频催荔子红，蝉声凉带芰荷风。\n林塘好是清和候，无奈君行向海东。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13323,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白华园送客口号 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"残梦微茫逐水流，送君帆席影沉浮。\n他时倘忆罗阳月，应有音书到石楼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13324,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"舟中望庐山有怀玉川门道者","author":"屈大均","text":"瀑布高悬三石梁，湖波荡漾白云光。\n仙人双足垂明月，绝世风流不可忘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13325,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"鄂渚曲","author":"屈大均","text":"江汉南流有合时，情人咫尺苦生离。\n散花洲上空相忆，却月城边自不知。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13326,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"复归沙亭柬从兄泰士 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"故园又复返沙亭，绕屋峰峦作画屏。\n兄弟行中吾与子，遗书真解读骚经。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13327,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"复归沙亭柬从兄泰士 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"素馆依然水木间，四围多是未名山。\n最高峰好惟烟管，与子长乘采药閒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13328,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"复归沙亭柬从兄泰士 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"无多白发不教催，一月童颜驻一回。\n吾道自令颜色好，金精石髓本尘埃。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13329,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"壬戌人日作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"何曾一日得为人，五十三年未见春。\n人日休为人日酒，年年人日总伤神。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13330,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"壬戌人日作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"闺人生日是今朝，花落兰房久寂寥。\n十二年来罢人日，泪珠为酒滴妖娆。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13331,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"壬戌人日作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"江山虽好恨无人，不用莺声换好春。\n人日与谁还燕饮，英雄一一作青燐。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13332,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送人还姑孰 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"牛渚孤从天际浮，天门双夹大江流。\n开平古庙多松柏，归对风烟一片秋。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13333,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送人还姑孰 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"虎踞江间惟采石，江南门户此为雄。\n千秋战鼓声犹在，愁尔真人想像中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13334,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"族兄鸣生翁八十有一生日口占为寿 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"地当南极老人多，况复沙亭满太和。\n兄在吾宗今最长，千钟将奈寿星何。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13335,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"族兄鸣生翁八十有一生日口占为寿 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"兄采芝华弟采薇，薇香不似紫芝肥。\n衣冠甚伟他年得，与尔同扶鸿鹄飞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13336,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"族兄鸣生翁八十有一生日口占为寿 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"君年一百还馀九，是我如君八十时。\n倘得杖朝兼杖国，求兄海上与安期。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13337,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"族兄鸣生翁八十有一生日口占为寿 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"今宵只有岁星明，织女银河渡未成。\n欲为吾兄酌天酒，碧梧枝上露华清。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13338,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"玉河曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"千里桑乾入塞来，参差城阙镜中开。\n君王往日多凫雁，肯念思波太液回。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13339,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"玉河曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"二月流澌上玉河，酒楼一一俯晴波。\n春衣笑向垆头解，醉拥琵琶卧紫驼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13340,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"代送郎曲","author":"屈大均","text":"撑折千篙不上滩，留郎一日不胜难。\n郎情不似鸬鹚石，日日双浮水上寒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13341,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"代同公答蒲公","author":"屈大均","text":"采药凌峰不觉遥，耶溪频负道猷招。\n谈经近厌天花满，欲谢时人隐沃焦。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13342,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送诸骏男之蜀","author":"屈大均","text":"从今泪应竹枝歌，秋夜猿声三峡多。\n况复峨嵋一片月，飞来飞去奈君何。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13343,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"从军行 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"将军教射五千人，荆楚奇材总绝伦。\n秋出阑干当一队，骁腾不逐贰师尘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13344,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"从军行 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"千骑横穿卤阵还，髦头一夜落天山。\n军中女子皆诛尽，士气飞扬战鼓间。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13345,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}}]